items.raw:
Let us define the following integers:


\begin{itemize}
\item  $b_l(p)$;  the ramification index of $f_l:C\rightarrow C_l$ in the point  $p\in C$.
\item  $b_l=\sum_{p\in C}b_l(p)$; the total ramification index of $f_l:C\rightarrow C_l$.
\item  $d_l$; the number  of osculating $l$-planes of $C$ which intersects a generic $(n-l-1)$-plane of ${\mathbb{P}}^{n}$. Observe that $d_0$ is simply the degree of the curve.
\end{itemize}

